ts/steam/apps/2307350/extras/79d57af19c42984d5544b1d5aa1757e1.mp4?t=1769076786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your potential by collecting artifacts scattered throughout the Pechorsk Anomaly. Unlock new abilities and powers as you delve deeper into their mysteries, gaining an edge against the horrors that await. Keep an eye out for valuable treasures amidst the artifacts, as selling them will earn you the funds needed to acquire new weapons and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307350/extras/f8401b654bf8435bfdea64be6d975f99.webp?t=1769076786\" width=600 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307350/extras/e3d80fc1bbcd742b795286d64a56a27d.poster.avif?t=1769076786\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307350/extras/e3d80fc1bbcd742b795286d64a56a27d.webm?t=1769076786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307350/extras/e3d80fc1bbcd742b795286d64a56a27d.mp4?t=1769076786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when exploring the zone, as you can encounter dangerous anomalies at every turn. Some of these can harm your health, while others can create impassable obstacles, forcing you to look for a way around. Use your arsenal of useful tools to avoid the epicenter of a deadly entity and stay alive.</p>","developers":["CM IMMERSIVE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.